    "working_thesis": "Hannah Arendt reconsiders the human condition through the tripartite framework of the vita activa (labor, work, and action) and investigates the historical transformations of the public and private realms, arguing against traditional metaphysical hierarchies and diagnosing the modern rise of society and the dangers of world-alienation."
